# Copy to .env and fill in to use --live mode. Never commit real keys.
#
# REQUIRED for --live: Gemini recipe parsing (uses your Gemini API credits).
#   Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the Gemini model (default: gemini-3.5-flash)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
# Optional: cheaper model JUST for the flyer analyzer (the bulk token consumer).
# Falls back to GEMINI_MODEL. Lets recipe parsing stay on a stronger tier while
# bulk item-matching runs on a cheaper one (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §5 option H).
# GEMINI_ANALYZER_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
#
# Set PANTRYDEAL_DEBUG=1 to log per-call Gemini token usage to stderr (the
# measurement baseline for the cost work in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §5).
#
# NOTE: live flyer data (Backflipp) and live geocoding (Zippopotam) are KEYLESS.
#
# Optional alternative integrations (not used by the default --live path):
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   for src/integrations/claudeRecipe.ts
#   GOOGLE_PLACES_KEY   for src/integrations/googlePlaces.ts
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACES_KEY=
